1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Start in Review. Highlight the relevant text

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
to open a comment box.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Describe what went wrong,

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
then press Enter to save your note.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Next, open Taxonomy.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Related comments appear in groups,
making recurring failure patterns easier to see.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Finally, review Agent suggestions.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Check the highlighted evidence
and proposed failure group.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Select a candidate, then accept or reject it
after reviewing the conversation.
